# Title: Enable BPF Kprobes Tracing
# ID: 7692f583-bd30-4008-8615-75dab3f08a99
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-01-25
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth
# Description: Detects common command used to enable bpf kprobes tracing
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* sourcetype="syslog" ((process_exec="*echo 1 >*" AND process_exec="*/sys/kernel/debug/tracing/events/kprobes/*") AND (process_exec="*/myprobe/enable*" OR process_exec="*/myretprobe/enable*"))
